WEBVTT

00:10.390 --> 00:12.320
Maa-kun!

00:12.830 --> 00:15.780
Where are you, Maa-kun?

00:17.010 --> 00:19.660
He's probably out doing his morning run, right?

00:19.660 --> 00:21.690
Without eating breakfast?!

00:26.930 --> 00:28.100
<i>It's spring, huh?</i>

00:28.500 --> 00:30.090
<i>Time really flies...</i>

02:13.930 --> 02:15.930
You're heading out, Yoshino?

02:15.930 --> 02:18.340
Y-Yes, um...

02:18.340 --> 02:19.360
A date?

02:20.450 --> 02:22.730
I-I'll be back soon, okay?

02:26.100 --> 02:28.170
She's such an open book.

02:33.500 --> 02:36.850
I'm starving... I'm actually starving!

02:36.850 --> 02:40.860
I should've had Yoshino 
make something before she left.

02:41.570 --> 02:44.890
N-No! I can't rely on her for everything!

02:44.890 --> 02:47.390
I need to be able to take care of myself!

02:53.400 --> 02:58.860
<b>Shinshu</b>

02:53.400 --> 02:58.860
Wasabi-Flavored
<b>Nozawana Mustard Leaf</b>

02:54.940 --> 02:58.860
Um, I brought you soba noodles 
and pickled nozawana leaves.

02:59.370 --> 03:01.400
I'm sorry I'm late.

03:01.400 --> 03:03.960
Do you not know how to use a phone?

03:03.960 --> 03:05.830
You just disappeared for the whole day!

03:05.830 --> 03:08.330
I know you were going to Shinshu, but...

03:15.260 --> 03:17.100
I was worried!

03:17.100 --> 03:18.330
I'm sorry.

03:19.630 --> 03:22.260
The pickled nozawana leaves are really good.

03:23.790 --> 03:26.180
Forget that. How did it go?

03:26.480 --> 03:27.770
Did it go well?

03:35.900 --> 03:37.970
<i>Warm up some cold rice...</i>

03:39.180 --> 03:40.690
<i>Put the pickled nozawana on...</i>

03:42.330 --> 03:43.290
<i>Add the tea.</i>

03:47.530 --> 03:50.960
<i>Ochazuke with nozawana leaf is so good!</i>

03:50.960 --> 03:55.180
<i>That's right! If I want to eat 
something, I can just make it myself!</i>

03:55.180 --> 03:57.360
<i>I could do this any time I wanted!</i>

03:57.360 --> 03:59.260
<i>Maybe it's because of the time 
I spent making chocolate?</i>

04:07.340 --> 04:10.190
<i>It's time to give it up, Adagaki Aki.</i>

04:10.720 --> 04:13.290
<i>Makabe and Yoshino are a couple now.</i>

04:24.150 --> 04:26.170
I'm in Class E, huh?

04:26.170 --> 04:27.140
Futaba-san!

04:27.140 --> 04:28.150
Class Rep!

04:29.580 --> 04:31.810
I look forward to another year together.

04:31.810 --> 04:33.650
Huh?! We're in the same class?

04:33.650 --> 04:40.740
Whew! I thought I'd be studying for entrance 
exams all by myself, but this'll be fun!

04:40.740 --> 04:41.880
Indeed.

04:41.880 --> 04:43.090
I hope so.

04:47.410 --> 04:50.990
Just because we're all together 
doesn't mean it'll be fun.

04:53.060 --> 04:54.700
Is that you, Gasou-san?

04:56.060 --> 04:57.910
That outfit...

04:57.910 --> 04:59.690
I'm finally getting used to it.

05:00.170 --> 05:01.630
You're giving me an eyeful!

05:11.340 --> 05:13.250
Koiwai-san is in Class E, too.

05:14.080 --> 05:17.230
It's our first time being in 
the same class, Koiwai-san!

05:19.770 --> 05:21.380
It's a whole new school year.

05:21.380 --> 05:23.470
I have no intention of dragging 
out any past feuds.

05:24.140 --> 05:26.100
I'm sorry for everything.

05:26.100 --> 05:27.760
Don't worry about it.

05:27.760 --> 05:30.510
This is Class E, and...

05:32.510 --> 05:34.480
Adagaki Aki   Hosokawa Yuuko
Amano Misaki   Makabe Masamune
Arakawa Yousuke   Maeda Kana

05:36.390 --> 05:37.390
<b>Adagaki Aki</b>

05:37.390 --> 05:38.350
<b>Makabe Masamune</b>

05:38.350 --> 05:40.720
Makabe-kun's in our class?

05:40.720 --> 05:42.380
Lucky us!

05:42.380 --> 05:43.940
Aki-sama! Aki-sama!

05:43.940 --> 05:45.210
We're together!

05:45.210 --> 05:49.620
Kaneko-senpai told me to do 
everything I could to help you.

05:49.620 --> 05:52.060
<i>Wait. Wait a second.</i>

05:49.620 --> 05:53.780
If there's anything you need, 
anything at all...

05:52.060 --> 05:54.150
<i>Is </i>this<i> what I get?</i>

05:55.700 --> 05:57.970
Hey, we're in the same class.

05:57.970 --> 06:00.400
<i>No!</i>

06:00.400 --> 06:02.370
H-How disappointing.

06:02.370 --> 06:05.970
I wish we could've been in different 
classes, but we're together.

06:05.970 --> 06:06.980
Yeah?

06:06.980 --> 06:09.300
It's better than not knowing 
any of your classmates, isn't it?

06:09.300 --> 06:11.010
She knows me!

06:11.280 --> 06:13.820
Well, I guess we'll be seeing 
each other in class.

06:13.820 --> 06:15.970
<i>Screw you!</i>

06:18.740 --> 06:19.940
<i>Hell.</i>

06:20.400 --> 06:22.490
<i>This is Hell!</i>

06:32.260 --> 06:34.030
Adagaki-san, Adagaki-san.

06:34.450 --> 06:37.260
Do you know the answer to question 4?

06:37.260 --> 06:40.300
O-Of course I do.

06:40.300 --> 06:41.160
Seriously?

06:41.160 --> 06:42.710
Can I see your answer?

06:43.140 --> 06:45.060
Oh, I see...

06:45.060 --> 06:46.470
So that's how it works.

06:48.420 --> 06:52.610
<i>Don't talk to me so casually.</i>

06:52.610 --> 06:56.710
<i>It's like... It's like when we were dating!</i>

06:59.500 --> 07:02.010
<i>I'll just do my best not to look at him.</i>

07:02.010 --> 07:03.120
<i>That's right!</i>

07:03.120 --> 07:05.620
<i>I can just keep my distance!</i>

07:10.890 --> 07:13.860
<i>Just the right amount of salt, 
if I do say so myself.</i>

07:30.490 --> 07:34.470
Why do I have to hide like this?!

07:32.690 --> 07:34.470
Oh, Adagaki-san!

07:35.930 --> 07:37.340
Did you try this new bread thing?

07:37.340 --> 07:39.600
Gasou told me about it.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.410
It's a limited-time-only special!

07:44.900 --> 07:46.260
What's your problem?

07:46.900 --> 07:48.850
What are you trying to do here?

07:48.850 --> 07:49.780
What?

07:50.090 --> 07:51.240
I wanted to apologize—

07:51.240 --> 07:52.150
Pig's Foot.

07:52.530 --> 07:53.860
Koiwai-san?

07:53.860 --> 07:55.180
Don't.

07:55.180 --> 07:56.040
But I—

07:56.040 --> 07:58.130
Just come with me.

08:07.130 --> 08:09.810
Don't shove it in my face like that, 
you two lovebirds!

08:14.660 --> 08:16.170
Koiwai-san, stop!

08:16.170 --> 08:18.020
Call me Yoshino.

08:18.620 --> 08:21.100
Yoshino-san, you're being aggressive.

08:22.090 --> 08:25.060
Not yet. Just a little more.

08:25.670 --> 08:27.050
Now's not the time.

08:30.020 --> 08:33.410
Wait just a little longer, and then...

08:44.950 --> 08:46.630
<i>Okay, here I go!</i>

08:46.920 --> 08:48.150
<i>I have to move on!</i>

08:52.330 --> 08:54.020
I'm back.

08:54.970 --> 08:56.390
You're late.

09:04.830 --> 09:07.220
Whaaa?!

09:07.220 --> 09:10.090
I didn't know you could yell like that.

09:10.090 --> 09:13.840
Wh-Wh-Wh-What happened 
to your hair? Your hair!

09:13.840 --> 09:15.820
I just needed a change of pace.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.980
It's not that big a deal...

09:18.410 --> 09:20.650
No, that's not true.

09:20.650 --> 09:24.330
I just couldn't get over him like I was, 
so I decided to change things up.

09:25.210 --> 09:26.500
Aki-sama...

09:26.500 --> 09:28.220
You don't need to call me "Aki-sama."

09:28.220 --> 09:30.290
I'm just a coward who's trying 
everything she can.

09:31.380 --> 09:32.860
No...

09:34.050 --> 09:37.010
You've got it all wrong, dummy!

09:37.010 --> 09:40.050
I just wanted to play a little trick on you!

09:40.050 --> 09:42.100
Yoshino? A "trick"?

09:42.100 --> 09:44.160
If you want to know, go to the school!

09:44.160 --> 09:45.140
The classroom!

09:45.140 --> 09:47.220
Pig's Foot is there!

09:47.220 --> 09:47.990
Huh?

09:48.300 --> 09:49.420
Just go!

09:51.850 --> 09:53.690
What's gotten into you?

09:53.690 --> 09:56.970
Fine! I'm going! That's what you want, right?

09:58.890 --> 10:04.160
<i>Maybe this is how Aki-sama felt 
when she watched us leave together...</i>

10:15.770 --> 10:18.550
<i>That day, I finally understood.</i>

10:23.180 --> 10:24.970
<i>No cell signal...</i>

10:25.450 --> 10:27.310
<i>Total darkness, with nobody around...</i>

10:27.940 --> 10:33.610
<i>Spending eight years up here 
thinking of just one person...</i>

10:34.870 --> 10:36.290
<i>You can't call that anything but...</i>

10:49.380 --> 10:50.960
<i>But even so...</i>

10:52.210 --> 10:54.820
<i>I still had to say it!</i>

11:08.330 --> 11:11.180
<i>So... Aki-sama, you do it, too!</i>

11:18.940 --> 11:20.650
Where are you, Makabe?

11:21.150 --> 11:24.300
I came, like your darling asked me to!

11:26.580 --> 11:29.750
For Adagaki Aki

11:30.380 --> 11:33.300
This is what I did before...

11:34.060 --> 11:36.000
Is this his way of getting back at me?

11:36.000 --> 11:37.480
He's gonna regret this!

11:37.480 --> 11:39.380
I'll give him a talking-to he won't forget!

12:03.620 --> 12:05.030
<i>It's so strange...</i>

12:05.400 --> 12:08.950
<i>No matter where I go, it feels like he's here.</i>

12:09.700 --> 12:12.870
<i>I have so many memories here, too.</i>

12:13.130 --> 12:16.580
<i>It's been more than enough time 
for "hate" to turn to "love."</i>

12:30.270 --> 12:31.570
Makabe?

12:33.460 --> 12:34.660
Adagaki-san?

12:35.300 --> 12:36.740
I knew you'd be here!

12:36.740 --> 12:38.190
Stay right where you are!

12:38.190 --> 12:40.240
I'm on my way!

12:39.790 --> 12:41.660
Huh? What's she saying?

12:40.240 --> 12:41.780
Don't you dare move!

12:41.660 --> 12:42.510
I can't hear her...

12:43.010 --> 12:44.610
What did you say?

12:59.350 --> 13:01.100
What are you doing there?

13:01.100 --> 13:02.810
That's my line!

13:03.470 --> 13:04.700
Wait, wait, wait!

13:04.700 --> 13:07.510
That girl just can't stay put, can she?

13:15.730 --> 13:17.850
You're in for such a talking-to!

13:29.510 --> 13:31.620
Gotcha!

13:42.670 --> 13:46.130
You made me run across half the damn 
school, you gun-jumping rich girl!

13:46.130 --> 13:48.880
What does that even mean?!

13:48.880 --> 13:51.970
Just leave me alone already!

13:51.970 --> 13:54.740
I can tell you two are having 
the time of your lives together!

13:54.740 --> 13:57.140
But I wanted to apologize...

13:57.810 --> 14:01.820
You don't need to apologize for dating Yoshino!

14:04.730 --> 14:06.070
I'm not dating her.

14:06.570 --> 14:07.860
I'm not dating Yoshino.

14:09.740 --> 14:10.750
Huh?

14:10.750 --> 14:13.080
She asked me to, but I said no.

14:19.360 --> 14:21.150
M-Master?

14:23.820 --> 14:24.730
Master...

14:25.510 --> 14:26.530
Master.

14:28.230 --> 14:29.180
Master.

14:30.510 --> 14:32.570
What? What is it?

14:34.100 --> 14:36.930
I love you, Pig's Foot.

14:39.390 --> 14:43.400
You came all the way out here 
to tell me that, huh?

14:44.410 --> 14:45.020
Yeah.

14:47.980 --> 14:49.190
Thanks.

14:49.190 --> 14:51.520
You're always there for me.

14:51.520 --> 14:53.210
I rely on you way too much.

14:54.380 --> 14:56.040
You surprised me, though...

14:56.040 --> 14:57.180
Pig's Foot...

14:57.970 --> 15:00.330
There's something I have to say, too.

15:00.780 --> 15:02.450
But the person I have to say it to is...

15:03.820 --> 15:07.050
<i>I spent a lot of time thinking about this. 
Maybe it's a waste of time.</i>

15:07.420 --> 15:11.940
<i>But I need to say it again, 
this time from the heart,</i>

15:11.940 --> 15:13.130
<i>or I can't move on.</i>

15:23.950 --> 15:25.220
<i>Yeah.</i>

15:25.860 --> 15:28.610
<i>You need to really mean it, 
or you won't be able to move on.</i>

15:31.530 --> 15:32.430
<i>So...</i>

15:33.090 --> 15:35.260
<i>Go get 'em, Pig's Foot!</i>

15:39.770 --> 15:41.810
You're not dating?

15:41.810 --> 15:43.920
Then what are you apologizing for?

15:43.920 --> 15:46.280
When I was fat, eight years ago,

15:46.280 --> 15:48.820
I was sure you'd rejected me 
in a really mean way.

15:48.820 --> 15:51.460
So I wanted to get revenge.

15:51.460 --> 15:53.390
That's why I came to this school.

15:54.340 --> 15:56.790
But I was wrong about everything.

15:56.790 --> 16:00.460
What I've been doing this whole time... 
Why any of this happened...

16:00.460 --> 16:02.260
I didn't even know anymore.

16:02.260 --> 16:03.850
I didn't know what to do.

16:04.310 --> 16:06.660
I've made you suffer for so long...

16:07.070 --> 16:10.970
But even so... my letter...

16:11.690 --> 16:12.820
Letter?

16:12.820 --> 16:14.640
The one in your hand.

16:14.640 --> 16:16.110
You haven't read it yet?

16:16.990 --> 16:19.630
I was hoping you'd read it tomorrow...

16:20.290 --> 16:21.420
Tomorrow?

16:21.420 --> 16:23.510
And then we ran into each other...

16:28.960 --> 16:30.920
Please be my girlfriend
-Makabe Masamune

16:37.460 --> 16:39.190
Will you be my girlfriend?

16:49.210 --> 16:50.470
Aki-chan!

16:51.750 --> 16:53.170
Masamune...

16:56.470 --> 16:58.450
This is how I feel about you!

16:58.450 --> 17:00.290
Please accept them!

17:01.940 --> 17:02.890
You're sure?

17:03.250 --> 17:04.320
Huh?

17:04.320 --> 17:06.000
You want someone like me?

17:07.730 --> 17:09.490
I don't want anyone but you!

17:16.290 --> 17:17.710
You cut your hair.

17:18.300 --> 17:21.270
You rejected Yoshino? Are you stupid?

17:22.940 --> 17:26.370
Are you serious about dating me?

17:26.370 --> 17:27.620
Is that bad?

17:27.620 --> 17:30.950
And wait, you like me?

17:30.950 --> 17:33.400
I mean, I guess you could say that...

17:33.400 --> 17:34.890
You "could" say that?

17:34.890 --> 17:36.160
Is this some kind of joke?

17:36.160 --> 17:40.860
You're the only person 
I could work so hard for.

17:42.660 --> 17:46.460
When it all started, I was fat, 
but you were my goal.

17:47.170 --> 17:51.250
Adagaki Aki, the girl who was 
a huge brat, but so beautiful...

17:52.470 --> 17:55.310
I'll probably still make tons of mistakes 
and screw-ups from now on.

17:55.900 --> 18:00.090
But as long as I'm heading toward 
you, I feel like I'll be okay.

18:01.710 --> 18:04.680
So this is all for your own sake, huh?

18:05.010 --> 18:05.950
Yeah.

18:06.300 --> 18:09.570
You self-centered, 
self-obsessed, selfish egoist.

18:10.540 --> 18:12.400
So... what's your answer?

18:14.900 --> 18:15.830
No...

18:16.360 --> 18:17.780
My answer's not "no."

18:18.360 --> 18:19.660
Yes!

18:19.660 --> 18:21.300
But are you sure?

18:21.300 --> 18:22.250
About what?

18:22.250 --> 18:24.790
Can you... kiss me and stuff?

18:25.700 --> 18:26.700
Of course I can!

18:30.730 --> 18:33.050
W-Wait! I need to do warm-up stretches first!

18:33.050 --> 18:34.020
Oh, come on!

18:34.570 --> 18:36.930
I'm just... really nervous...

18:37.340 --> 18:39.130
I get it, but...

19:10.000 --> 19:13.090
No!

20:45.440 --> 20:50.890
Five, four, three, two, one!

20:47.470 --> 20:49.430
<b>42nd Yasaka High School Cultural Festival</b>

20:50.890 --> 20:51.790
I'm lighting it!

20:56.350 --> 20:58.820
The post-festival party will now begin.

20:59.100 --> 21:02.350
Those of you who will be participating 
in the dance, come to the center.

21:11.870 --> 21:15.860
Once this is over, it's time to start 
studying for entrance exams.

21:15.860 --> 21:19.700
I don't want to get separated from everyone!

21:20.260 --> 21:22.340
Come on, that's still a long way off.

21:22.340 --> 21:24.770
It's not that long at all!

21:24.770 --> 21:26.060
That's right.

21:26.060 --> 21:27.940
It's not that much longer at all.

21:28.430 --> 21:30.050
What, you, too?

21:30.050 --> 21:35.070
I mean, we had that Snow White battle and 
everything at last year's cultural festival.

21:35.770 --> 21:40.730
The winner got to dance with Adagaki-san 
at the post-festival party, right?

21:40.730 --> 21:45.610
W-Well, you know, Makabe and 
Aki-chan ended up appearing together,

21:45.610 --> 21:47.860
and everyone kind of forgot about it.

21:47.860 --> 21:50.700
So she didn't dance with anyone, but...

21:53.980 --> 21:59.540
Before, I thought that 
Masamune-sama liked you.

22:00.390 --> 22:01.970
It's not like that.

22:01.970 --> 22:04.220
I'm his "master."

22:04.220 --> 22:06.530
That's why he didn't break out in hives.

22:06.530 --> 22:09.330
Because he feels safer 
around me than anyone else.

22:09.330 --> 22:10.390
I see.

22:10.730 --> 22:15.620
So I can assume he saw me 
as an attractive woman, then?

22:15.620 --> 22:18.600
He didn't end up with either of us, though.

22:20.090 --> 22:22.520
Futaba-san said before

22:22.520 --> 22:26.320
that if you truly fall in love, there's 
something that will always remain with you.

22:27.750 --> 22:30.780
There were a lot of mix-ups along the way,

22:30.780 --> 22:33.530
but I think this was for the best.

22:34.500 --> 22:35.930
Yeah.

22:37.920 --> 22:43.160
There was a chance I'd end up dancing 
with Gasou Kanetsugu back then.

22:43.160 --> 22:44.360
No way.

22:44.360 --> 22:46.140
I would've stopped it, no matter what.

22:46.140 --> 22:49.210
Even though you were out with a fever?

22:49.210 --> 22:50.980
Anything to dance with you.

22:53.090 --> 22:54.900
Now, once more...

22:55.720 --> 22:58.370
My great wish, my great ambition...

22:58.370 --> 23:00.270
Will you do me the honor of a dance?

23:04.590 --> 23:07.400
Is this your revenge? Or...

23:08.210 --> 23:11.130
My respect. For the Cruel Princess.

23:14.890 --> 23:18.170
I think I could give you the 
perfect nickname now.

23:19.090 --> 23:20.080
Want to know what it is?

23:21.570 --> 23:23.540
I'll ask later, I think.
